      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Pinehills%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Pinehills hosts two daily‑fee public 18‑hole golf courses and a private club nestled among its neighborhoods.",
